{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block content %}
<section class="dest-hero"><div class="wrap split">
  <div>
    <h1>Paradise Lens: the monthly photo contest</h1>
    <p class="lede">Share your best photo from anywhere in Mexico. Each month's winner is featured on our home page and wins that round's prize, funded by supporters and sponsors. Free to enter.</p>
    <div class="callout"><p><b>This round: {{ theme_month }}.</b> Theme: "Water and light". Cenotes at noon, Pacific sunsets, lagoon sunrises, rain over the jungle. Entries close on the last day of the month at 23:59 Mexico City time.</p></div>
    <h2 class="mt6">How it works</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><b>Upload your photo</b> to a public link you control (Instagram post, Google Drive, Dropbox or your portfolio).</li>
      <li><b>Send the entry form</b> with the link, where it was taken and a one-line caption.</li>
      <li><b>Judging</b> happens in the first week of the next month on three criteria: sense of place, light and composition, and story.</li>
      <li><b>Winners</b> are announced on this page and contacted by email.</li>
    </ol>
    <h2 class="mt6">Prizes</h2>
    <p>Each round's prize is announced at the start of the month. Prizes are provided by our supporters and sponsors and may include a stay, a tour, gear or a cash award, plus a featured credit on Paradise.mx. <a href="{{ root }}advertise/">Sponsor a prize</a> to put your brand in front of travellers.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="panel panel-shadow">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem">Enter this month</h2>
    <form class="form" data-form="contest-entry" data-subject="Paradise.mx CONTEST entry - {location} - {name}" data-ok="Entry received. Good luck! We'll email you if your photo is selected." novalidate>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="field"><label for="ct-name">Name or photo credit</label><input id="ct-name" type="text" name="name" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="ct-email">Email</label><input id="ct-email" type="email" name="email" required></div>
      </div>
      <div class="field"><label for="ct-url">Photo link</label><input id="ct-url" type="url" name="photo_url" placeholder="https://" required><p class="hint">Make sure the link is viewable without signing in.</p></div>
      <div class="field"><label for="ct-loc">Where was it taken?</label><input id="ct-loc" type="text" name="location" placeholder="e.g. Cenote Suytun, Valladolid" required></div>
      <div class="field"><label for="ct-cap">Caption (optional)</label><input id="ct-cap" type="text" name="caption" maxlength="200"></div>
      <div class="field"><label for="ct-ig">Instagram handle (optional)</label><input id="ct-ig" type="text" name="instagram"></div>
      <label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="age_and_rules" value="yes" required> I am 18 or older, I took this photo, and I accept the official rules below.</label>
      <label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="license" value="yes" required> I grant Paradise.mx a non-exclusive, royalty-free licence to display my photo on paradise.mx and its social channels with credit. I keep my copyright.</label>
      <input class="hp" type="text" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Submit my entry</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="band band-agua"><div class="wrap narrow prose">
  <h2 style="margin-top:0" id="rules">Official rules (summary)</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><b>No purchase or donation is necessary</b> to enter or win. Supporting Paradise.mx does not improve your chances.</li>
    <li>Open to individuals aged 18 or over, where permitted by law. Void where prohibited. Employees and contractors of Paradise.mx and prize sponsors, and their immediate families, may not enter.</li>
    <li>One entry per person per round. Photos must be your own original work, taken in Mexico, and must not infringe anyone's rights. Recognisable people must have agreed to be photographed. No minors as main subjects.</li>
    <li>Photos may be edited for colour and exposure but must not be composites or AI-generated.</li>
    <li>Winners are chosen by a judging panel on sense of place (40%), light and composition (40%) and story (20%). Judges' decisions are final.</li>
    <li>Winners must reply within 14 days to claim their prize, or an alternate winner may be selected. Prizes are non-transferable and cannot be exchanged for cash unless stated. Winners are responsible for any taxes.</li>
    <li>We use entry details only to run the contest and contact winners, as described in our <a href="{{ root }}privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</li>
    <li>Paradise.mx may cancel or change a round if circumstances outside its control prevent it from running fairly, and will post any change on this page.</li>
  </ol>
</div></section>
{% endblock %}
